                    "group_name": "Bio-Integrated Textiles",
                    "group_summary": "This theme focuses on redefining the fabric itself as a living ecosystem. By embedding microbes directly into fibers or designing textiles to host biofilms, these solutions aim for continuous, passive hygiene and a dramatic reduction in the garment's lifecycle impact.",
