                    "group_summary": "This theme leverages synthetic biology to create textiles with advanced, active functionalities. These concepts move beyond passive digestion to enable on-demand detergent production, energy-driven cleaning, and entirely new 'smart fabric' capabilities.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Engineered Microbial Systems for Advanced Fabric Functionality",
                    "one_liner_summary": "Fabrics integrated with engineered microbes that can produce cleaning agents on-demand or use external energy sources like light or electricity to power decomposition.",
