                        "idea_summary": "This concept creates a bio-electric fabric that actively degrades grime by turning it into electricity. By embedding electrogenic bacteria and conductive fibers, the garment itself becomes a micro-scale microbial fuel cell that powers its own cleaning process, offering a high-tech approach to hygiene.",
