                    "uuid": "0382c103-8e22-452a-a5ba-34e0064820a0",
                    "group_name": "Living Textiles & Smart Fabrics",
                    "group_summary": "This theme focuses on embedding engineered biological systems directly into textiles, creating fabrics that possess inherent self-cleaning or regenerative capabilities. The strategic value lies in eliminating the need for separate cleaning products and drastically reducing laundry frequency.",
