                    "group_name": "Biocatalytic Consumables & Tools",
                    "group_summary": "This theme explores a range of external products—from sprays to patches to laundry additives—that leverage engineered biocatalysts for highly efficient, low-water cleaning. The strategic value is in offering powerful, targeted solutions that can be easily integrated into existing consumer habits.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Applied Biocatalysts for Low-Water Cleaning & Stain Removal",
                    "one_liner_summary": "A portfolio of consumable products and tools that apply engineered microbes or their byproducts to clean textiles with minimal water.",
                    "selling_point": "These solutions offer superior, targeted cleaning performance in familiar formats, providing a low-barrier entry point for consumers to adopt water-saving hygiene practices.",
