                        "mode_of_action": "1. User sprays the affected area of the garment. 2. The live microbes in the solution colonize the stain. 3. They sense the target contaminant and secrete specific, high-efficiency enzymes to degrade it. 4. After a set time, the residue and deactivated microbes can be blotted or lightly rinsed off.",
