                        "idea_summary": "A 'living laundry pod' or reusable 'bio-bead' that activates in a small amount of water to clean an entire load of laundry. This replaces voluminous liquid detergents with a hyper-concentrated dose of biological cleaning power, enabling hygienic cleaning in minimal-water tumbling systems.",
