                        "mode_of_action": "1. A pod or set of beads is added to a low-water washing machine or tumbler with clothes. 2. The pod dissolves or the beads make contact, releasing/activating the microbes. 3. The microbes rapidly secrete a broad spectrum of enzymes, degrading soil throughout the load via mechanical and biological action. 4. A minimal rinse cycle washes away the microbes and soil.",
