                        "idea_summary": "A maintenance spray that deposits a 'shield' of beneficial probiotic bacteria onto clothing, which outcompetes odor-causing microbes for space and nutrients. This preventative approach maintains freshness and extends the time a garment can be worn, reducing the frequency of water-intensive washing.",
