                        "idea_summary": "A fabric treatment containing dormant microorganisms that, upon detecting a high concentration of soil, autonomously migrate and aggregate to form a concentrated 'cleaning hotspot'. This approach mimics natural biofilm formation to focus cleaning power precisely where it's needed without user intervention.",
