                        "mode_of_action": "1. Fabric is uniformly treated with dormant microbes. 2. When a significant soil or stain occurs, it creates a chemical gradient. 3. Microbes detect this gradient and migrate towards the source, forming a dense, active biofilm. 4. The concentrated microbial activity rapidly breaks down the stain.",
