                        "optimized_idea": "Light-Activated Self-Cleaning Fabric with Photosynthetic Microbes",
                        "idea_summary": "A fabric embedded with photosynthetic microorganisms (like algae or cyanobacteria) that are metabolically activated by light. When exposed to sunlight or artificial light, these microbes actively decompose organic soils and produce antimicrobial compounds, offering a waterless, energy-efficient cleaning cycle.",
