                        "optimized_idea": "Single-Dose Microbial Cleaning Pod for Low-Water Tumbling",
                        "idea_summary": "A single-use, water-soluble pod containing a payload of dormant, soil-activated microbes and a humidity-releasing agent. The user tosses the pod into a low-water tumbler or even a sealed bag with their clothes; the pod dissolves, releasing the microbes which activate and clean the garments.",
