                        "optimized_idea": "Biosurfactant Lifting and Refreshing Mist",
                        "idea_summary": "A low-water cleaning mist that leverages the potent lifting power of microbially-produced surfactants to dislodge grime and oils from fabric. Unlike enzymatic cleaners that degrade soils, this approach physically lifts them, allowing for a near-waterless 'rinse' by simply wiping or blotting the treated area.",
