                        "mode_of_action": "1. The biosurfactant mist is sprayed onto the garment. 2. The surfactant molecules surround oil and dirt particles, reducing their adhesion to the fibers. 3. The encapsulated soil is then easily removed by blotting with a cloth or through light agitation. 4. The garment air dries quickly due to the low water volume.",
