                    "group_name": "Functionalized Fibers & Fabrics",
                    "group_summary": "This theme focuses on embedding cleaning and protective functionalities directly into the textile fibers, creating garments that are inherently self-cleaning, antimicrobial, or soil-repellent. The innovation lies in making the fabric itself the active agent, moving from a \"do\" to a \"be\" model of cleaning.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Bio-Integrated Textiles for Continuous and Proactive Hygiene",
