                        "optimized_idea": "Engineered Nanovesicle (OMV) Delivery Spray",
                        "idea_summary": "A bio-nanotechnology spray that uses nature's own delivery system—bacterial vesicles—to deploy cleaning enzymes with extreme precision and potency. This approach protects the enzymes until they reach their target and enhances their penetration into soils, offering superior performance compared to free enzymes in solution.",
                        "core_principle": "Engineered Outer Membrane Vesicles (OMVs), harvested from bacteria, are used as natural nanocarriers to deliver a highly concentrated payload of cleaning enzymes directly to stains.",
