                        "idea_summary": "Smart textiles store cleaning agents in microscopic, protective capsules that rupture or become permeable in response to specific triggers like moisture, friction, or the presence of a stain. This enables a highly targeted, 'on-demand' release of a potent cleaning dose precisely where and when it's needed, maximizing efficiency and minimizing waste.",
