                    "uuid": "1466992d-50a8-474d-a2a1-e8ae58dd3577",
                    "group_name": "Topical Bio-Cleaning Solutions",
                    "group_summary": "This theme explores externally applied, biochemically-driven products like sprays and additives that enable garment cleaning and refreshing with little to no water. These solutions provide on-demand care, complementing or replacing traditional washing.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Topical Biochemical Treatments for Water-Minimal Garment Care",
                    "one_liner_summary": "This theme develops a range of consumer products, such as mists and pods, that use concentrated enzymes and biosurfactants for waterless refreshing or ultra-low-water washing.",
