                        "idea_summary": "This concept moves beyond coatings to creating textiles fundamentally composed of mycelial fibers, which are naturally antimicrobial and potentially odor-resistant. By building the hygiene function into the core material, the need for washing is significantly reduced, addressing the water scarcity challenge at the material science level.",
