                    "group_name": "Advanced Delivery & Stabilization Systems",
                    "group_summary": "This theme directly addresses the core technical challenge of maintaining the viability and activity of biological agents through innovative delivery mechanisms like encapsulation, core-shell fibers, and shelf-stable formulations.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Advanced Formulation & Fiber Engineering for Bio-Agent Delivery",
