                        "mode_of_action": "1. Soiled clothes and a set of bio-active beads are placed in a tumbler. 2. The machine tumbles the load without adding bulk water. 3. The beads physically knock dirt loose from the fabric. 4. The biofilm on the beads' surface adsorbs and metabolizes the organic contaminants. 5. After the cycle, the clean clothes are removed, and the beads remain in the machine, ready for the next load.",
