                        "mode_of_action": "1. User selects the stain type on the device. 2. The device rehydrates the appropriate cell-free system from a cartridge. 3. It synthesizes a small, potent dose of the targeted cleaning agent. 4. User applies the freshly synthesized compound directly to the garment.",
