                        "idea_summary": "A cleaning appliance that forgoes tumbling entirely, instead pressing clothes through a multi-layered cleaning pad with minimal pulsed water. This approach combines intense physical pressure with layered filtration and biological action for efficient, low-water cleaning of durable fabrics.",
                        "core_principle": "Garments are cleaned by being physically pressed between or passed through layered pads that provide sequential physical and biological cleaning actions, mimicking a vertical flow system.",
