                        "mode_of_action": "1. A garment is fed into the device. 2. It is pressed between layered pads, which may include a coarse layer for debris removal and a bioactive layer for organic soils. 3. A minimal pulse of water is injected and squeezed through the fabric to facilitate contaminant transfer. 4. The clean, damp garment exits the device.",
