                        "mode_of_action": "1. Clothes are placed in the chamber. 2. The unit initiates a cycle, potentially starting with an anaerobic phase to break down tough soils. 3. It then shifts to an aerobic phase for complete purification. 4. Water used in the process is filtered through a living 'Schmutzdecke' layer and stored for the next wash. 5. Electrical fields can be used to accelerate the process.",
