                        "optimized_idea": "Self-Regulating Biofilm-Integrated Fabric",
                        "idea_summary": "A textile designed to host a persistent, self-regulating biofilm that continuously purifies the fabric by breaking down pollutants and pathogens. This approach mimics the robust 'Schmutzdecke' purification system, creating a durable and resilient self-cleaning material.",
