                        "core_principle": "Combines biosensors with microfluidics to create a closed-loop detection and response system integrated directly into a garment.",
                        "form_factor": "A garment interwoven with a network of flexible sensors and micro-channels connected to reservoirs of lytic or enzymatic agents.",
                        "mode_of_action": "1. A sensor in the fabric detects a target molecule (e.g., from a pathogen or sweat). 2. The sensor signals a micro-pump to activate. 3. The pump pushes a small amount of liquid cleaning agent through micro-channels to the exact location of the sensor. 4. The agent neutralizes the target.",
