                        "optimized_idea": "Engineered Microbial Consortia for Continuous Fabric Conditioning",
                        "idea_summary": "Instead of a single microbe, this concept involves inoculating fabric with a designed 'microbial guild' where different species work together. Some microbes break down specific soils (oils, proteins), while others outcompete odor-causing bacteria or condition the fabric, creating a resilient, self-maintaining ecosystem on the textile.",
