                        "idea_summary": "A smart, reusable patch that houses a curated biofilm for potent cleaning. When applied to a stain, it uses microfluidics to deliver a minuscule amount of water and nutrients to the biofilm, which then metabolizes the soil locally without saturating the surrounding fabric.",
