                        "idea_summary": "A preventative treatment where dormant microbes are applied across a garment. These microbes are engineered to only activate and form a concentrated cleaning 'hotspot' upon contact with specific molecules found in sweat, oils, or food stains, enabling a highly targeted, 'intelligent' cleaning response.",
