                    "group_name": "Low-Water Bioreactor Systems",
                    "group_summary": "This theme focuses on external devices that mimic natural, multi-stage purification processes to clean garments with minimal water. The innovation lies in creating a compact, closed-loop system that uses sequential biological action to break down a wide range of soils.",
