                        "idea_summary": "Textiles are embedded with a dormant, beneficial microbiome that activates with ambient humidity or a light mist to continuously break down soil and neutralize odors. This 'living fabric' approach creates a self-cleaning garment that drastically reduces the need for water-intensive washing, directly mimicking a natural purification ecosystem.",
