                        "idea_summary": "Cleaning agents like enzymes or microbes are stored in protective microcapsules embedded in the fabric, releasing their payload only when triggered by moisture or friction. This approach enables a long shelf-life and targeted, on-demand cleaning action, differentiating from continuously active surfaces.",
