                        "idea_summary": "Textiles are treated with a chemical agent that provides durable antimicrobial protection and can be 'recharged' to full strength with a simple, low-water trigger like a light mist or a pH-adjusting spray. This approach provides long-lasting, renewable hygiene without requiring full laundering, extending the garment's use cycle significantly.",
