                        "optimized_idea": "Myco-Integrated Self-Sanitizing Textiles",
                        "idea_summary": "This concept uses fungal mycelium—the root structure of fungi—as a functional, self-sanitizing component of clothing. Mycelial fibers or coatings can provide inherent antimicrobial and water-repellent properties, reducing odor buildup and soiling to extend wear time between washes.",
