                    "group_name": "Biological & Bio-Inspired Systems",
                    "group_summary": "This theme leverages biological action, either from living microbes or their isolated enzymes, to actively break down soil and maintain hygiene. Directly inspired by the Schmutzdecke concept, these solutions offer a sustainable, low-energy path to cleaning.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Biological and Bio-Inspired Systems for Fabric Purification",
                    "one_liner_summary": "This approach uses living probiotic ecosystems or immobilized enzymes integrated with the fabric to continuously digest soil and neutralize odors.",
