                    "group_name": "On-Demand & Responsive Systems",
                    "group_summary": "This theme moves away from passive or continuous cleaning to focus on systems that are activated on-demand by the user. These solutions involve renewable chemical agents, novel trapping mechanisms, or smart materials that change properties to enable low-water cleaning when needed.",
                    "descriptive_title": "On-Demand and Responsive Systems for Activated Cleaning",
                    "one_liner_summary": "This theme develops textiles that can be recharged, cleaned mechanically after trapping soil, or triggered to shed dirt using smart materials.",
