                    "group_name": "Prevention & Easy-Release Surfaces",
                    "group_summary": "This theme explores fabrics engineered to either completely prevent soil adhesion or enable contaminant removal with minimal physical force like mist or air. The focus is on manipulating surface physics to fundamentally change the relationship between the fabric and dirt.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Advanced Surface Physics for Soil Prevention and Low-Force Cleaning",
                    "one_liner_summary": "A portfolio of textile surfaces that use omniphobic coatings and biomimetic textures to prevent soiling and enable cleaning with minimal water or even just air.",
