                        "idea_summary": "A fabric with an ultra-low adhesion surface designed to completely prevent particulate matter from bonding. This enables a 'dry cleaning' process where dirt and dust can be dislodged and removed with zero water, using only mechanical forces like shaking, vibration, or a gentle puff of air.",
