                        "idea_summary": "An advanced coating that combines omniphobic and antimicrobial properties with a self-healing capability to dramatically extend the garment's functional lifespan. This approach addresses a key failure mode of traditional coatings—wear and tear—by enabling the fabric to repair minor abrasions and maintain its hygienic, easy-clean properties over time.",
