                "description": "Solutions that utilize engineered microscale or hierarchical micro/nano surface structures and topographies on textiles to enhance contaminant repellency, release, or anti-fouling capabilities, potentially enabling cleaning with minimal water/contact. This includes biomimetic hierarchical structures within fibers.",
