                    "name": "Ideas that use piercing/needle-like or disruptive nano-topographies for physical microbial disruption",
                    "description": "Solutions that utilize engineered nanostructures with piercing or needle-like morphologies (e.g., nanopillars, or general nano-scale topography for disruption) to physically disrupt and kill microorganisms on contact.",
