                        "idea_summary": "An omniphobic textile with a self-lubricating surface that creates an ultra-low-adhesion barrier, preventing even sticky or oily substances from gaining a foothold. Unlike textured superhydrophobic surfaces, SLIPS offers a smooth, robust barrier that is less susceptible to physical damage.",
