                "name": "Ideas that utilize materials derived from renewable biological resources (base materials)",
                "description": "Solutions that focus on using base materials for textiles that are primarily sourced from renewable biological origins (e.g., plant-based polymers, microbial cellulose, bio-grown/cultivated fibers, protein-based biopolymers).",
                "parent_uuid": "c5144daf-030f-47b9-8193-9fda1cc58ca8",
