                        "optimized_idea": "Biofilm-Coated Tumbler Beads for Low-Water Mechanical Cleaning",
                        "idea_summary": "This concept replaces water in a washing machine with reusable, biofilm-coated beads. As the beads tumble with clothes in a humid environment, they provide mechanical scrubbing while their living microbial layer simultaneously metabolizes organic soil, achieving a deep clean with a fraction of the water.",
                        "core_principle": "Combining mechanical action with a mobile, living biological purification surface within a low-moisture tumbling environment.",
