                    "group_name": "Enzymatic Self-Cleaning Fabrics",
                    "group_summary": "This theme bridges biology and material science by integrating non-living, highly stable enzymes into fabric. This approach captures the catalytic power of biology without the complexity and risk of maintaining a living microbiome on a garment.",
