                "name": "Ideas that engineer textiles for durability against aggressive cleaning methods",
                "description": "Solutions that engineer textile materials to be highly resistant to damage or degradation from harsh, non-conventional cleaning methods involving aggressive energies or chemistries.",
                "parent_uuid": "c5144daf-030f-47b9-8193-9fda1cc58ca8",
                "created_at": "2025-06-11T05:06:28.809000",
