                "name": "Ideas that prioritize the long-term durability of functional textile properties or coatings",
                "description": "Solutions where a primary design goal is the extended operational lifetime and robustness of a textile's functional properties, such as soil repellency or antimicrobial activity, or the integrity of a functional coating.",
                "parent_uuid": "c5144daf-030f-47b9-8193-9fda1cc58ca8",
