                        "mode_of_action": "1. The fabric is treated with a durable omniphobic coating. 2. Liquid and particulate contaminants encountering the surface are repelled and cannot adhere. 3. Soil can be removed by shaking, brushing, or a light rinse, with minimal water and no detergent required.",
