                        "idea_summary": "Textiles embedded with photocatalytic nanoparticles (e.g., TiO2) that, when exposed to light, actively break down organic soil and kill microbes. This 'rechargeable' self-cleaning capability minimizes washing frequency and water usage.",
                        "core_principle": "Leveraging photocatalysis, where light energy activates embedded semiconductor nanoparticles to generate reactive oxygen species that degrade organic matter and microbes.",
