                        "idea_summary": "A fabric finish where potent cleaning enzymes are immobilized directly onto the fibers, creating a textile that actively digests organic soils. This 'always-on' cleaning capability is activated by ambient humidity or light misting, continuously maintaining fabric hygiene.",
