                    "group_summary": "This collection of ideas focuses on low-water, high-precision consumables designed for spot treatment and localized cleaning. Instead of washing an entire garment, these solutions use patches, powders, or mists to deliver potent cleaning agents only where needed, dramatically improving resource efficiency.",
