                        "idea_summary": "A disposable or reusable patch that uses microfluidic channels to deliver a precise, minimal dose of a potent cleaning solution directly to a stain. This approach removes localized soiling with near-zero water waste, offering a highly targeted alternative to washing an entire garment.",
