                        "idea_summary": "A hybrid textile that incorporates both light-activated photocatalysts for general decomposition and targeted enzymes for breaking down specific, stubborn stains (e.g., oils, proteins). This offers a more comprehensive and efficient self-cleaning action than either technology could achieve alone.",
