                        "form_factor": "A chamber or cabinet where garments can be hung and exposed to a uniform atmospheric pressure plasma field generated by internal electrodes.",
                        "mode_of_action": "1. Garments are hung inside the plasma chamber. 2. An electric field is applied across electrodes, ionizing the air inside and creating a low-temperature plasma. 3. The generated reactive species interact with the fabric surfaces, breaking down organic soils and neutralizing pathogens. 4. The system is deactivated, and the plasma dissipates.",
