                "description": "Solutions that use materials with specific adsorptive or binding properties (potentially regenerable fibers, extracted biological components, bio-inspired non-living sorbents, micro-scale particulates, bulk natural sorbents like GAC/charcoal/clays, or high-affinity dry contact materials) to trap and retain soil, odors, or other contaminants from textiles, or to selectively capture specific substances. This can include electrostatic attraction or chemically modified biopolymers.",
