                    "group_name": "Intelligent Self-Cleansing Fabrics",
                    "group_summary": "This theme integrates cleaning functionality directly into the textile's structure, creating garments that actively manage contamination and odors. The innovation lies in engineering the fabric itself to be a durable, reusable cleaning system.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Integrated Fiber Technologies for Continuous Garment Decontamination",
                    "one_liner_summary": "This theme focuses on embedding chemical or biological agents directly into fabric fibers to continuously trap or neutralize contaminants at the source.",
