                "name": "Ideas that concentrate contaminants into a removable carrier phase",
                "description": "Solutions that achieve cleaning by physically concentrating contaminants from a textile into a distinct, easily removable carrier phase or material.",
                "parent_uuid": "ed1d6437-b79e-4e88-80c3-b1cbc26d3f1b",
                "created_at": "2025-06-11T05:06:28.809000",
