                        "idea_summary": "Reusable ceramic beads coated with a durable, engineered biofilm for use in a low-water tumbling machine. Mechanical agitation transfers soil from clothes to the beads, where the biofilm metabolizes the contaminants, offering a contained and regenerable biological cleaning system.",
                        "core_principle": "Combines mechanical soil transfer with biological degradation on a separate, reusable solid-phase media.",
