                        "core_principle": "Uses concentrated, low-moisture activated biosurfactants to break the bonds between stains and fabric for easy removal.",
                        "form_factor": "A dry-to-the-touch, disposable fabric sheet.",
                        "mode_of_action": "1. User applies a drop of water to the sheet or the stain. 2. The sheet is pressed onto the stain, releasing biosurfactants. 3. The surfactants lift the stain into the sheet. 4. The sheet is removed and discarded.",
