                        "mode_of_action": "1. Garment is placed inside the pod. 2. The generator creates ozone or HPV vapor, filling the chamber. 3. The gas penetrates the fabric, oxidizing microbes and odor molecules. 4. After the cycle, a converter breaks down any remaining reactive gas, leaving the garment sanitized and deodorized.",
