                        "mode_of_action": "1. Clothes are placed in the drum with a very small amount of water/surfactant. 2. Ultrasonic transducers create cavitation bubbles that implode on the fabric surface, dislodging particles. 3. Pulsed air jets provide additional shear force to strip away loosened biofilms. 4. Dirt is suspended in the minimal water and drained.",
