                    "group_name": "Abiotic Active Surfaces",
                    "group_summary": "This theme focuses on engineering the textile itself with non-living, active properties that either catalytically destroy, chemically neutralize, or physically adsorb odor molecules. These solutions provide persistent cleaning action without the complexities of maintaining a living biological system.",
