                        "optimized_idea": "Light-Activated Photocatalytic Textiles for Self-Deodorization",
                        "idea_summary": "A fabric coated or infused with photocatalytic nanoparticles (e.g., TiO2, ZnO) that, when exposed to ambient or UV light, generate reactive oxygen species to break down odor molecules and organic compounds. This provides a continuous, water-free method for maintaining garment freshness.",
