                        "mode_of_action": "1. A fine mist containing probiotic bacteria is sprayed onto the garment. 2. The probiotics colonize the fabric fibers. 3. They consume the resources and secrete compounds that inhibit the growth of undesirable microbes. 4. The garment's microbiome is rebalanced, neutralizing and preventing odors.",
