                        "idea_summary": "A completely waterless cleaning powder, derived from absorbent biomaterials like mycelium, that is applied to clothes to lift and trap dirt. This 'dry shampoo for clothes' approach allows soil to be simply brushed or shaken off, offering a truly water-free cleaning method.",
