                    "group_name": "Direct-to-Fabric Bio-Active Sprays",
                    "group_summary": "This theme explores various sprayable formulations that apply microbial or bio-derived agents directly onto textiles for tasks ranging from preventative hygiene to active stain removal, all with minimal water. This approach offers convenience and targeted action without requiring a washing appliance.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Microbial & Bio-derived Sprays for Waterless Fabric Cleaning and Maintenance",
                    "one_liner_summary": "This approach uses spray-based delivery systems to apply live microbes, enzymes, or biological vesicles directly onto fabric for cleaning and odor control.",
