                        "form_factor": "A fine mist spray bottle for direct application to clothing.",
                        "mode_of_action": "1. A light mist of the probiotic solution is sprayed onto clean or lightly worn clothes. 2. The beneficial microbes colonize the fabric fibers. 3. They outcompete odor-causing bacteria for nutrients and space, preventing odors from developing.",
