                "name": "Ideas that use micro/nano-reservoirs or encapsulation for controlled agent release",
                "description": "Solutions that use microscopic or nanoscopic compartments, capsules (microencapsulation, potentially core-shell), or reservoirs embedded within a textile to store and provide controlled, sustained, or triggered release of functional agents (including biologicals with nutrients), potentially activated by physiological cues or stimulus-induced rupture/permeabilization.",
