                    "group_summary": "This group explores consumable products—patches, sprays, and pods—that leverage microencapsulation to deliver highly concentrated cleaning agents for targeted or low-volume application. This strategy provides user-controlled, on-demand cleaning that is compatible with existing garments and offers new, water-efficient product formats.",
