                        "idea_summary": "A waterless cleaning solution in a spray or powder format, this product uses microcapsules containing enzymes, essential oils, or absorbents. When applied to clothing, the capsules adhere to the fabric, release their payload to neutralize odors or break down soils, and can then be brushed or shaken off, offering a true 'dry-to-dry' refresh.",
                        "core_principle": "Leverages microencapsulation and spray-drying technology to create a powder or aerosol spray that delivers cleaning or deodorizing agents for a waterless 'dry cleanse' application.",
