                    "group_summary": "This approach uses non-living, potent biological molecules like enzymes and botanical extracts in concentrated, reusable formats. It delivers the cleaning power of biology without the complexity of maintaining a living system.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Stabilized Biochemical Agents for Waterless Refreshing",
                    "one_liner_summary": "A set of concepts using sprays and reusable sheets impregnated with stabilized enzymes and botanical extracts to chemically break down stains and odors.",
