                        "idea_summary": "A reusable cleaning sheet infused with powerful, immobilized enzymes for 'contact-based' stain removal. By pressing the dampened sheet against a stain, users can deliver a highly concentrated dose of enzymatic action directly where it's needed, offering a durable, non-living alternative to biofilm patches.",
                        "core_principle": "Stabilized enzymes are immobilized within the matrix of a reusable textile sheet, enabling repeated, targeted enzymatic breakdown of stains through direct physical contact.",
