                    "group_name": "Intelligent Dosing & Delivery Systems",
                    "group_summary": "This theme centers on the 'how' of delivery, focusing on sophisticated, pre-portioned units that enable radical efficiency. These concepts range from micro-dosing applicators for spot treatments to self-regenerating bioreactor cartridges for appliances.",
