                        "form_factor": "A water-soluble pod or tablet for single-dose laundry applications.",
                        "mode_of_action": "1. A single pod is added to a laundry load with minimal water. 2. The pod dissolves, releasing its contents. 3. Enzymes and biosurfactants immediately begin breaking down and lifting soils. 4. Microbes activate and continue to metabolize remaining organic matter over the wash/soak cycle.",
