                        "idea_summary": "A durable, reusable cartridge containing immobilized, living mycelium that continuously secretes a cocktail of powerful cleaning enzymes (e.g., lipases, proteases) into the wash cycle. This approach enables highly effective cleaning in minimal water by effectively turning the appliance into a bioreactor.",
                        "core_principle": "Leverages the natural ability of fungi to secrete a wide range of extracellular digestive enzymes, creating a continuous, self-regenerating source of cleaning agents within a controlled system.",
                        "form_factor": "A rigid, porous cartridge designed to be inserted into a specialized low-water washing machine or cleaning appliance.",
