                        "idea_summary": "A flexible, adhesive patch containing micro-reservoirs of concentrated cleaning agents (e.g., enzymes, solvents) and a network of microfluidic channels. The patch delivers a precise, microliter-scale dose directly into a stain, achieving maximum cleaning effect with virtually no water waste.",
