                    "uuid": "eae3a753-0749-4311-8f7a-15d88fcb57d5",
                    "group_name": "Functional Cleaning Surfaces",
                    "group_summary": "This theme explores reusable or disposable accessories that function as active cleaning surfaces, removing contaminants from clothing through direct contact via biological degradation or physical adsorption. These solutions reframe cleaning from a submersion process to a surface interaction.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Active Contact Surfaces for Non-Aqueous Garment Cleaning",
                    "one_liner_summary": "This theme explores mats, films, and sheets that clean clothing through direct physical contact, either by digesting or trapping and removing soil.",
