                        "optimized_idea": "Biological Contact Cleaning Mat (Mycelium/Biofilm)",
                        "idea_summary": "This concept is a living, reusable 'cleaning mat' made from fungal mycelium or a beneficial biofilm, onto which clothes are pressed or rolled. The mat acts as both a biological digester and a physical sponge, breaking down and absorbing dirt, oils, and odors through direct contact, replacing the need for a water-intensive wash cycle.",
                        "core_principle": "A living mat of fungal mycelium or a cultivated biofilm secretes a cocktail of enzymes to break down organic soil while its physical structure absorbs and traps particulates.",
