                        "mode_of_action": "1. A soiled garment is placed or pressed onto the active surface of the mat. 2. A minimal amount of mist can be applied to enhance the interaction. 3. The mat's enzymes degrade soils, and its structure traps dirt. 4. The garment is removed, cleaner and refreshed. The mat is self-regenerating.",
