                        "mode_of_action": "1. A pod is added to a load of laundry with a small amount of water. 2. The pod dissolves, releasing the dormant microbes. 3. The microbes activate and begin digesting the soil on the clothes. 4. After the cycle, the water is drained, requiring minimal rinsing.",
