                        "optimized_idea": "Light-Activated Antimicrobial Wardrobe Liner",
                        "idea_summary": "A preventative solution that keeps stored clothes fresh by actively inhibiting the growth of odor-causing microbes. This wardrobe liner is activated by ambient light, creating an inhospitable environment for bacteria and fungi, thereby reducing the need for frequent washing in the first place.",
                        "core_principle": "A surface treated with a photocatalytic or light-activated antimicrobial agent (e.g., titanium dioxide, specific dyes) generates reactive oxygen species when exposed to ambient light, inhibiting microbial growth on nearby clothing.",
