                        "optimized_idea": "Miniaturized Pad-Dry-Cure Appliance for Waterless Cleaning and Re-Treatment",
                        "idea_summary": "An in-home appliance that adapts the industrial 'pad-dry-cure' textile finishing process for consumer use. The system applies a precise, minimal amount of cleaning or functional solution (e.g., antimicrobial, water-repellent) to a garment and then uses integrated heat or light to cure it, achieving a 'dry wash' and finish restoration with near-zero water.",
                        "core_principle": "Adapts the industrial textile process of 'pad-dry-cure'—saturating fabric with a chemical solution, removing excess, and then curing—into a miniaturized, low-resource consumer application.",
