                        "mode_of_action": "1. A garment is placed in the appliance. 2. It is lightly padded or misted with a functional cleaning solution. 3. The appliance then applies controlled heat or UV light to dry the garment and cure the treatment onto the fibers. 4. The entire cycle uses only a few milliliters of liquid.",
