                        "idea_summary": "This technology brings lab-on-a-chip precision to stain removal, enabling the delivery of potent cleaning agents with pinpoint accuracy. By using microfluidic channels, it can treat a stain with an extremely small amount of liquid, achieving a highly effective clean with virtually no water waste.",
                        "core_principle": "Microfluidic channels, either integrated into a flexible patch or the garment itself, deliver precise, microliter volumes of cleaning agents directly to a targeted area, minimizing liquid usage and spread.",
