                        "core_principle": "Uses high-intensity light, such as UV-C or light that triggers an Advanced Oxidation Process (AOP), to sanitize fabrics inside a contained device.",
                        "form_factor": "A rigid pod, flexible bag, or cabinet-like device with an internal light source and reflective lining.",
