                    "group_name": "Preventative Surfaces",
                    "group_summary": "This group focuses on preventative material science, engineering fabric surfaces to be inherently resistant to soiling and contamination. The core strategy is to minimize the need for cleaning by preventing dirt, oils, and liquids from adhering in the first place.",
