                    "group_name": "Active Surfaces (Non-Biological)",
                    "group_summary": "This theme explores textiles with surfaces that are not merely passive but actively participate in the cleaning process through physical or chemical means. These solutions provide continuous or on-demand cleaning action directly on the garment, often triggered by ambient conditions like light.",
