                        "idea_summary": "A household-scale Membrane Bioreactor (MBR) that treats laundry greywater, enabling continuous reuse of a small water volume for multiple wash cycles. This system combines biological treatment with physical membrane filtration to achieve high-purity water, drastically reducing net water consumption.",
