                        "mode_of_action": "1. Laundry effluent enters the bioreactor tank. 2. A microbial community (biofilm) breaks down detergents and soils. 3. Water is drawn through a fine-pore membrane, which retains bacteria and suspended solids. 4. The purified water is returned to the washing appliance for the next cycle.",
