                    "descriptive_title": "Biological Agents for Self-Sustaining Laundry Systems",
                    "one_liner_summary": "A portfolio of solutions that use living microbes or enzymes to metabolize soils, enabling closed-loop water recycling and on-demand cleaning agent production.",
