                        "idea_summary": "A 'living' cartridge containing immobilized mycelium that continuously secretes a cocktail of cleaning enzymes directly into the wash cycle. This eliminates the need for liquid detergents and enables potent cleaning with minimal water, as the enzymes are produced on-demand.",
                        "core_principle": "Leverages genetically optimized or selected mycelium as a micro-factory to produce and secrete targeted cleaning enzymes in-situ.",
