                        "form_factor": "A fine powder, similar to a dry shampoo, composed of absorbent materials (e.g., cyclodextrin, silica) and potentially encapsulated enzymes or surfactants. It is applied from a shaker or aerosol can.",
                        "mode_of_action": "1. The powder is sprinkled or sprayed onto the garment. 2. It is lightly worked into the fabric and left for a short period to absorb soil and odors. 3. The garment is shaken, brushed, or vacuumed to remove the powder along with the trapped contaminants.",
