                        "optimized_idea": "Electrostatic Wand for Waterless Particulate Removal",
                        "idea_summary": "This device acts like a 'dust magnet' for clothes, using static electricity to actively pull dry contaminants off of fabric. This provides a completely water-free and chemical-free method for cleaning clothes of particulate soil, ideal for quick refreshes and for people with chemical sensitivities.",
                        "core_principle": "Electrostatic forces are used to attract and lift dry particulate matter (dirt, dust, microbes) from fabric surfaces without the use of any liquids.",
