                        "idea_summary": "A small, flexible, and reusable patch containing a biofilm of specialized, soil-degrading microbes on a conductive fabric. When placed on a stain and activated with a tiny electrical current, the patch becomes a highly accelerated bioreactor that 'eats' the stain with minimal water.",
                        "core_principle": "Microbial Electrocatalysis, where an applied electrical potential enhances the metabolic activity and digestive enzyme expression of microorganisms, dramatically speeding up the breakdown of organic stains.",
