                        "mode_of_action": "1. Garment is placed on the mat. 2. Minimal water or vapor is introduced to activate the biological layer. 3. User applies pressure (e.g., with a roller or by standing on it). 4. Contaminants are wicked into the mat, trapped by physical layers, and digested by the biofilm.",
