                    "group_summary": "This theme focuses on non-biological methods that leverage advanced physics and process engineering to achieve hygiene with minimal liquid. These concepts use mechanical energy or precision chemical application to replace the solvent and transport functions of water.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Physico-Chemical Mechanisms for Ultra-Low Liquid Fabric Cleaning",
                    "one_liner_summary": "A set of solutions using ultrasonic waves, microfiltration membranes, and precision roller application to physically remove contaminants or apply renewing agents with near-zero water.",
