                        "mode_of_action": "1. The device's membrane is slightly dampened. 2. The wand is passed over the fabric surface. 3. Ultrasonic vibrations loosen dirt, dust, and microbes from fibers. 4. The micro-membrane physically traps and removes the dislodged particulates.",
