                    "group_name": "Advanced Material Surfaces",
                    "group_summary": "This group moves from reactive cleaning to proactive prevention by engineering the fabric surface itself. These material science solutions aim to stop soiling and microbial growth before they start, or provide novel ways to maintain hygiene with minimal intervention.",
