                        "optimized_idea": "Closed-Loop Laundry Appliance with Integrated Water Bioreactor",
                        "idea_summary": "A closed-loop laundry system that uses a small, fixed amount of water (e.g., 5 liters) over and over again for multiple wash cycles. After each use, the greywater is passed through an integrated bioreactor that removes soils and contaminants, returning purified water to the system for the next wash, drastically reducing household water consumption.",
                        "core_principle": "Integrates a compact biological water treatment system (bioreactor) directly with a washing appliance to continuously purify and recycle a small, fixed volume of water.",
