                        "mode_of_action": "1. Garments are placed inside a sealed chamber. 2. The chamber is conditioned to a specific humidity and temperature. 3. VHP is introduced, filling the chamber and penetrating the fabric to kill microbes. 4. A catalytic converter or aeration cycle breaks down the VHP into harmless water and oxygen before the door can be opened.",
