                    "group_summary": "This theme investigates methods that use physical forces and precisely controlled atmospheric conditions—like humidity, temperature, and pressure—as the primary cleaning mechanism. Its strategic value is in minimizing or eliminating chemical/biological consumables, creating a robust and supply-chain-independent solution.",
