                    "group_name": "Smart Hygiene Monitoring & Verification",
                    "group_summary": "This theme focuses on data-driven solutions for garment care. It includes both embedded sensors that monitor cleanliness in real-time and external tools that can verify if hygiene standards have been met, replacing guesswork with objective measurement.",
