                        "optimized_idea": "Handheld Spectroscopic Scanner for Verifying Post-Cleanliness Hygiene Standards",
                        "idea_summary": "A handheld 'hygiene scanner' that uses advanced spectroscopy to provide a definitive, quantitative assessment of a garment's cleanliness. This tool can verify if a low-water cleaning method has successfully removed contaminants and neutralized microbes, providing crucial quality control for novel hygiene practices.",
