                    "group_summary": "This group focuses on biological cleaning solutions that are applied to or used with a garment, rather than being integrated into its fabric. These concepts include consumer-friendly sprays, targeted patches, and low-water appliances, offering practical and accessible ways to leverage biotechnology for laundry.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Topical Applications and Devices for Biological Garment Care",
                    "one_liner_summary": "A range of solutions including topical sprays, targeted-cleaning patches, and dedicated low-water appliances that use biological agents to clean and refresh clothing.",
