                    "group_summary": "This group focuses on integrating biological agents—either isolated enzymes or living, dormant microbes—directly into textiles or modular patches. The cleaning function is switched on by minimal moisture or other stimuli, enabling highly efficient, low-water metabolic degradation of contaminants.",
