                        "form_factor": "A composite textile fiber with a liquid or solid core containing a cleaning agent (e.g., enzyme, surfactant, sanitizer) and a protective outer sheath.",
                        "mode_of_action": "1. Fibers are produced with an inner core of cleaning agent and a protective outer shell. 2. When the shell is compromised by moisture or friction, the active core is exposed. 3. The released agent acts directly on the adjacent stain or microbes. 4. The reaction is contained and requires no external water.",
