                "name": "Ideas that feature 'smart textiles' with autonomous contaminant detection and responsive cleaning",
                "description": "Solutions that feature 'smart textiles' or intelligent systems capable of autonomously detecting specific contaminants, pathogens, or hygiene status (potentially with co-localized or spatially-resolved sensors/agents, or microbial signaling), and initiating a corresponding, optimized cleaning, disinfection, or resource management response, possibly adapting method/intensity or controlling networked micro-units.",
                "parent_uuid": "e883e6d1-3425-4688-8fdf-ec07da1331fc",
