                        "idea_summary": "This approach uses a probiotic spray to create a protective 'shield' on clothing, preventing odor before it starts. Rather than breaking down existing dirt, it focuses on preemptively colonizing the fabric with 'good' bacteria to block 'bad' bacteria from gaining a foothold, thus extending garment freshness.",
