                    "group_summary": "This theme explores on-demand solutions where biological agents are applied to clothing to target specific cleaning needs, such as stains or general refreshing. These concepts leverage microbial intelligence to concentrate cleaning power only where and when it's needed, offering highly efficient, low-water alternatives to a full wash.",
