                        "mode_of_action": "1. The user applies the flexible, living patch directly onto a stain or odorous area (e.g., underarm). 2. Microbes within the patch activate with minimal moisture and begin to metabolize the contaminants. 3. The patch can be 'smart,' sensing the type of soil to optimize its cleaning action. 4. After a set time, the user removes the patch, which has absorbed and degraded the soil. 5. The patch can be 'recharged' in a nutrient solution for reuse.",
