                        "idea_summary": "This idea moves beyond single-microbe solutions to deploy a 'team' of specialist microbes that can tackle complex stains and contamination. This adaptive consortium can sense the chemical makeup of a soil and activate the right 'specialists' for the job, offering a sophisticated and highly effective low-water cleaning treatment.",
                        "core_principle": "A precisely formulated consortium of specialist microbes, or 'guild,' is applied to clothing to work synergistically to break down complex, multi-component soils and pathogens.",
