                        "mode_of_action": "1. A spray containing a diverse microbial guild (e.g., lipid specialists, protein specialists, pathogen specialists) is applied to a garment. 2. The microbes detect the specific contaminants present. 3. The relevant microbial specialists activate and begin their targeted degradation process. 4. The consortium works together, with the byproducts of one specialist potentially serving as fuel for another, leading to complete soil breakdown.",
