                        "idea_summary": "This concept packages microbial cleaning power into a convenient, shelf-stable pod for a waterless 'dry fermentation' clean. Users add the pod to dry, soiled clothes in a contained environment (e.g., a bag or bin), where the microbes activate using the soil itself as fuel, offering a radical alternative to water-based washing.",
