                        "idea_summary": "This advanced fabric serves as a 'bio-factory,' hosting engineered microbes that produce and secrete their own detergents and enzymes when activated by moisture. Instead of just consuming soil, the fabric actively generates cleaning agents in-situ for a more powerful, targeted, and self-sufficient clean.",
