                        "idea_summary": "This 'smart' fabric acts as a targeted delivery system, releasing potent cleaning or sanitizing agents only when and where they are needed. This on-demand approach offers highly efficient, low-water cleaning by concentrating the chemical action directly at the site of contamination.",
                        "core_principle": "Incorporates encapsulated or bound chemical agents (e.g., enzymes, sanitizers, solubilizers) into fibers that are released or activated by a specific trigger, such as moisture, pH change, or the presence of a specific soil.",
