                        "optimized_idea": "High-Efficiency Mechanical and Chemical Cleaning Appliances",
                        "idea_summary": "This re-imagines the washing machine as a high-precision tool rather than a water-filled drum. By using forces like targeted air jets or catalyzed hydrogen peroxide vapor, this system can achieve deep cleaning and sanitization while using a fraction of the water and energy of conventional machines.",
                        "core_principle": "Applies highly efficient, targeted mechanical forces (e.g., focused air pulses, ultrasonic waves) or advanced chemical processes (e.g., catalyzed vapor) within a closed system to dislodge dirt and neutralize microbes with minimal liquid.",
