                    "group_summary": "This group focuses on non-living, molecular-level interventions that mimic biological functions. Instead of using active enzymes or microbes, these solutions alter the fabric's surface chemistry to trap, repel, or break down contaminants through bio-inspired molecular mechanisms.",
