                        "idea_summary": "An appliance that provides a 'dry-cleaning' level of sanitization at home using a safe, reactive vapor instead of water or solvents. This approach decouples hygiene from water consumption, offering deep cleaning and deodorization for delicate or hard-to-wash items.",
                        "core_principle": "Utilizes a contained, water-free process where a sanitizing gas (e.g., hydrogen peroxide vapor, ozone) permeates the fabric to neutralize microbes and deodorize the garment.",
                        "form_factor": "A sealed appliance, such as a cabinet, pod, or bag, equipped with a vapor generator and an aeration system.",
