                        "idea_summary": "A laundry system that recycles its own water, drastically reducing the water footprint of each wash cycle. By integrating a compact, efficient biological water treatment plant, this concept makes hygienic washing possible even in areas with extreme water scarcity.",
                        "core_principle": "Employs a closed-loop system where a small volume of water is continuously purified and recycled by a compact bioreactor, enabling multiple effective wash cycles with minimal net water consumption.",
