                    "uuid": "49bbd7df-8706-4a8d-a640-0f76a8b535b9",
                    "group_name": "Topical & Consumable Bio-Treatments",
                    "group_summary": "This group focuses on delivering biological cleaning agents—both living microbes and isolated enzymes—through user-applied formats like sprays and patches. These solutions provide on-demand, targeted cleaning for specific spots or general refreshing, reducing the need for full washes.",
                    "descriptive_title": "On-Demand Biological Agents for Targeted Garment Hygiene",
                    "one_liner_summary": "A portfolio of sprays and patches that deliver concentrated doses of living probiotics or enzymes for targeted stain removal and odor neutralization.",
