                        "mode_of_action": "1. The user applies the flexible biofilm patch to a soiled or odorous area of clothing. 2. A minimal amount of water (mist) activates the microbes in the biofilm. 3. The microbes metabolize the organic compounds in the stain/odor. 4. The patch is removed, leaving the area clean, and can be 'recharged' for future use.",
