                    "group_summary": "This group comprises on-demand solutions that apply biological agents (enzymes, probiotics) to clothing via sprays or patches. These approaches provide a convenient, water-frugal way to refresh garments, remove spots, and control odor between full washes, extending the wearable life of clothing while being gentle on fabrics.",
