                        "mode_of_action": "1. The user sprays a light mist onto the garment, focusing on areas like collars and underarms. 2. The enzymes make contact with organic soils (sweat, skin cells, food residue). 3. The enzymes catalytically break down the large molecules into smaller, water-soluble ones that evaporate or are no longer noticeable. 4. The garment is left to air dry, feeling and smelling fresh.",
