                    "group_name": "Smart & Responsive Fabrics",
                    "group_summary": "This group represents the future of textiles, where fabrics are no longer passive but are intelligent, responsive systems. These ideas use smart materials and integrated electronics to detect soiling and actively clean or release contaminants on demand, offering the highest level of convenience and resource efficiency.",
