                        "idea_summary": "This concept envisions a garment that can spot-clean itself from the inside out, representing the ultimate in precision cleaning. By detecting a soil and delivering a picoliter-scale dose of cleaner exactly where needed, it achieves maximum cleaning efficacy with near-zero water waste, all without user intervention.",
                        "core_principle": "Integrates microfluidic channels and sensors directly into a garment to detect the location of a stain and deliver a precise micro-dose of cleaning fluid to that specific spot.",
