                        "optimized_idea": "Gaseous Purification System with Active Aeration Removal",
                        "idea_summary": "A waterless cleaning system that purifies textiles using a reactive gas like ozone, followed by a mandatory and active aeration cycle to thoroughly flush the chamber and fabric of any remaining gas. This approach separates the potent cleaning phase from a critical safety and removal phase.",
                        "core_principle": "Utilizes oxidizing gases (e.g., ozone, reactive oxygen species) for sanitization, followed by forced aeration or filtration to dilute and remove residual gas to safe levels.",
