                        "optimized_idea": "Enzyme-Immobilized Textile for Catalytic Cleaning",
                        "idea_summary": "This concept creates an 'enzymatic textile' where cleaning enzymes are permanently grafted onto the fabric fibers. Unlike living microbes, this approach offers a stable, non-living catalytic surface that activates with minimal moisture to continuously break down stains and odors, reducing the need for detergent and water.",
