                    "group_summary": "This portfolio focuses on consumable products like sprays and patches that deliver a targeted dose of cleaning microbes or enzymes. These solutions are designed to extend the time between washes by managing odor and treating localized stains with minimal water.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Topical Bio-Active Treatments for Garment Refreshment and Spot Cleaning",
