                    "group_summary": "This group focuses on system-level innovations, including smart fabrics that diagnose their own cleanliness and advanced appliances that enable new, hyper-efficient cleaning processes. These concepts shift innovation from the cleaning agent alone to the intelligent control of the entire cleaning environment.",
