                    "uuid": "074531c0-e2d7-4fb7-96c6-99455e17f0cb",
                    "group_name": "External & On-Demand Bio-Treatments",
                    "group_summary": "This theme focuses on delivering biological cleaning power through external, modular tools rather than integrating it into the fabric itself. These solutions provide on-demand cleaning for existing garments, offering flexibility and targeted application.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Modular Biocatalytic Tools for On-Demand Garment Refreshment",
                    "one_liner_summary": "A portfolio of external tools like patches, sprays, and reusable agitators that apply concentrated biological agents to clean clothes without full washing.",
