                        "idea_summary": "A 'smart' fabric with embedded biosensors that precisely detects and reports on its hygiene status, or even triggers a localized, on-demand cleaning response. This shifts garment care from a fixed schedule to a data-driven, 'as-needed' process, maximizing resource efficiency.",
