                    "group_name": "Living Textiles & Probiotics",
                    "group_summary": "This group explores concepts that use living microorganisms—either integrated into the fabric or applied topically—to create a self-cleaning or hygiene-maintaining garment. It represents the most direct translation of the 'Schmutzdecke' principle to textiles.",
