                        "optimized_idea": "Programmable 'Smart Spores' for On-Demand Biosynthesis of Cleaning Agents",
                        "idea_summary": "This concept advances the 'living textile' by using genetically engineered microbes (GEMs) programmed to act as on-demand 'bio-factories'. Dormant spores embedded in the fabric activate with sweat or mist to produce and secrete specific cleaning agents, offering a highly targeted and efficient biological cleaning mechanism.",
