                        "mode_of_action": "1. The fabric is coated with a pH-sensitive polymer matrix containing an antimicrobial agent. 2. The garment is worn. 3. To refresh, the user applies a pH-adjusting mist (e.g., a citric acid solution). 4. The change in pH causes the polymer to swell or change conformation, releasing the antimicrobial agent to sanitize the fabric.",
