                    "uuid": "71fd00cf-8a0d-4ca5-86e0-cf0b39ed73e5",
                    "group_name": "Advanced Repellent Surfaces",
                    "group_summary": "This theme focuses on engineering the fabric's surface topography and chemistry to prevent soil adhesion, enabling contaminants to be removed with minimal force and water. It is a preventative approach to hygiene.",
                    "descriptive_title": "Bio-Inspired Material Surfaces for Contamination Prevention",
                    "one_liner_summary": "A portfolio of concepts that engineer the fabric's surface to prevent soil adhesion, enabling contaminants to be removed with minimal force and water.",
