                        "idea_summary": "This concept engineers a 'stay-clean' fabric surface that actively repels nearly all contaminants, from water and coffee to dirt and bacteria. By mimicking natural structures like the lotus leaf, this omniphobic coating prevents soiling in the first place, allowing contaminants to simply roll off or be wiped away without a trace.",
                        "core_principle": "Creating a hierarchical micro/nanostructure on the fabric surface, often combined with a low-surface-energy chemical coating, that minimizes contact area with liquids and particulates, causing them to roll off easily.",
