                        "mode_of_action": "1. The fabric is created with a micro/nanoporous structure. 2. A lubricating fluid is infused and held in place by capillary forces. 3. This creates a stable, liquid-over-solid surface. 4. Contaminants, including bacteria and oils, cannot adhere and slide off with minimal force (e.g., gravity).",
