                "description": "Solutions that aim to keep garments cleaner for longer by preventing dirt adhesion (e.g., via anti-fouling or passive surface properties that are strictly non-degradative), inhibiting microbial growth, or reducing the need for frequent cleaning in the first place. This includes disrupting microbial communication or using applied agents to prevent biofilm formation.",
