                        "idea_summary": "A textile with a built-in enzymatic cleaning system, where enzymes like those found in laundry detergents are permanently bonded to the fabric fibers. Activated by minimal moisture, these enzymes continuously digest stains and soils like sweat, oil, and food, providing targeted, low-water biological cleaning without living microbes.",
