                        "idea_summary": "This solution acts like a 'kombucha for your clothes,' introducing a healthy microbial culture to outcompete the undesirable bacteria that cause odors. Instead of killing all microbes, it rebalances the fabric's microbiome to maintain freshness and extend wear time between washes.",
                        "core_principle": "Applies a liquid suspension of beneficial, non-pathogenic microbes (probiotics) to fabric surfaces to create a temporary, competitive microbiome that displaces or inhibits odor-causing and pathogenic bacteria.",
