                    "descriptive_title": "Bio-Integrated Textiles for Continuous, Passive Cleaning",
                    "one_liner_summary": "A portfolio of textiles that are either alive with beneficial, soil-degrading microbes or are catalytically active with permanently embedded cleaning enzymes.",
