                        "idea_summary": "This concept creates 'catalytic clothing' by permanently bonding or embedding cleaning enzymes into the fabric fibers. This approach provides a continuous, low-moisture cleaning effect without relying on living organisms, offering a more stable and controllable alternative to self-cleaning.",
